Se  Dixit- learned Government Advocate for respondents- State.
 ORDER Per: Justice Hirdesh;
This intra-Court appeal under Section 2(1) of the Madhya Pradesh Uchcha Nyaylaya (Khand Nyay Peeth Ko Appeal), Adhiniyam, 2005 assailing the order dated 17-11-2025 passed by learned Single Judge of this Court in Writ Petition No. 1624 of 2025, whereby the writ petition filed by writ petition(herein appellant) has been dismissed.
